            q: 'What is Tree-of-Thought prompting?',
            a: 'Tree-of-Thought (ToT) prompting instructs a model to explore multiple reasoning paths — like branches of a decision tree — evaluate each one, and then select the best path before giving a final answer. Unlike linear chain-of-thought, ToT explicitly generates and compares alternatives.',
